      "id": "step-5-typescript-package",
      "title": "TypeScript Package — Parallel Implementation",
      "description": "The TypeScript package mirrors the Python package with full feature parity. Built with tsup, it ships both CommonJS and ESM formats. The architecture is more consolidated: all 20 tools live in a single tools.ts file using Zod schemas for input validation, utils.ts contains the NiaAPIWrapper (async-only via fetch), and toolkit.ts provides the same configurable NiaToolkit interface. Each tool extends LangChain's StructuredTool class.",
      "estimatedTime": 120,
      "focusDirectory": "libs/langchain-nia-js/src",
      "highlightLayers": [
