      "description": "The .github/ directory contains GitHub Actions workflows for linting, testing, codespell checks, test releases, and official releases. Custom actions and helper scripts automate the release pipeline for both packages. This ensures both the Python (PyPI) and TypeScript (npm) packages stay in sync and pass quality gates before publishing.",
